  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/4dzJ9yxX/Advanced-Netherite-Banner-V13.png\" alt=\"横幅\"></p><h1><strong>高级下界合金 (Forge / NeoForge)</strong></h1><p>这是 <strong>Forge / NeoForge</strong> 版本，点击<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>获取 Fabric 版本！</p><h5><strong>从 Minecraft 1.20.4 开始，高级下界合金也将支持 NeoForge！</strong></h5><p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p><h3><strong>📖 关于</strong></h3><p><strong>高级下界合金</strong>是一款可配置、原版友好且开源的模组，增加了更多下界合金的等级！该模组旨在通过添加更多可达成目标来扩展原版 Minecraft 的游戏体验。</p><p>更多信息请访问<a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">高级下界合金 Wiki</a>！</p><p>感谢 <a href=\"https://twitter.com/LizterZapZap\" rel=\"nofollow\">LizterZapZap</a> 创作了全新且经过优化的纹理！</p><p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p><h3><strong>✅ 特性</strong></h3><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/MTd6yX4W/Advanced-Netherite-Features-V11.png\" alt=\"特性\"></a></p><ul>\n<li>4 个<strong>全新</strong>的下界合金等级！</li>\n<li>每个新下界合金等级都包含对应的工具组、盔甲组和方块</li>\n<li>每个下界合金等级都有独特的属性（特殊盔甲增益、工具额外掉落）</li>\n<li>支持附加组件和数据包</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p><h3><strong>💎 下界合金等级</strong></h3><p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/MT1VXszQ/Types-Of-Netherite-Banner-V2.png\" alt=\"等级\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p><h3><strong>🔨 合成配方</strong></h3><p>模组合成配方可在<a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/wiki/Crafting-Recipes\" rel=\"nofollow\">高级下界合金 Wiki</a> 中找到，或通过安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI（Just Enough Items）</a> 查看！</p><p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p><h3><strong>🔖 热门版本链接</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=26.1.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 26.1.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.21.11\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.11</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.21.8\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.8</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.21.5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.21.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.21.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.20.6\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.20.6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.20.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.20.4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.20.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.20.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.19.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.19.4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.19.3\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.19.3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.19.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.19.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.18.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.18.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.18.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.18.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.17.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.17.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.16.5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.16.5</a></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p><h3><strong>ℹ 更多信息</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>请将问题报告至 <a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 问题追踪器</a>！</li>\n<li>我可以在我的 CurseForge 整合包中使用您的模组吗？当然可以！</li>\n<li>高级下界合金也提供了 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a> 版本。</li>\n<li>点击<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/screenshots\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>查看更多截图！</li>\n<li>访问 <a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">高级下界合金 Wiki</a> 了解该模组添加的全部内容。</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p><h3><strong>💬 加入我的 Discord 服务器！</strong></h3><p><em><a href=\"https://discord.gg/KP3BBatuw5\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我的 Discord 服务器</a>，获取更新通知、模组支持等更多内容！</em></p><p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p><h4><strong>⚠️ 免责声明</strong></h4><p>本模组仅通过 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fadvanced-netherite\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/releases\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方 GitHub 仓库</a>发布。请勿从其他下载源重新分发<em>或</em>下载本模组。</p><p>有关模组盗版的更多详情及如何保护自己，请访问：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstopmodreposts.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">stopmodreposts.org</a>。</p>",
